ase -> DIAMOND 2 GATE\", \"Requires both Day Release & Just a Scratch\", \"normal\", 5.1),\n910:         (\"Swamped -> Doin' Gone (Ch. 1 Climax)\", \"Clear Donnie's trailer -> Ready for PG cut\", \"climax\", 3.4),\n911:         (\"TRANSITION TO PORT GELLHORN\", \"Hard cut to Starlet Motel (Chapter 2)\", \"badge\", 1.8),\n912:     ]\n913:     for t, s, ct, cy in c1_items:\n914:         if ct == \"badge\":\n915:             draw_speedrun_badge(ax, c1_x, cy, mw, 1.15, t, s, font_size=7.2)\n916:         elif ct == \"heart\":\n917:             draw_heart(ax, c1_x, cy, mw, 1.15, t + \"\\n\" + s, skip_label=\"[CRITICAL GATE]\")\n918:         else:\n919:             draw_mission(ax, c1_x, cy, mw, 1.15, t, s, is_climax=(ct==\"climax\"))\n920:             \n921:     draw_arrow(ax, (c1_x + mw, 1.8 + 0.55), (cols_x[1] + 0.3, 17.5), color=\"#f43f5e\", rad=-0.3, lw=2.0)\n922:     \n923:     # ---------------- CHAPTER 2 COLUMN ----------------\n924:     c2_x = cols_x[1] + 0.3\n925:     c2_items = [\n926:         (\"23. What's in the Bag? -> 26. Just Moved In\", \"Starlet Motel Setup & Lucia Solo Recovery\", \"normal\", 17.2),\n927:         (\"28. Moses (Vehicle Fencing)\", \"Register required getaway car with Moses\", \"normal\", 15.6),\n928:         (\"29-37. Port Gellhorn Hustle\", \"Beeline through debt tasks (Ambulance/Daily Driver)\", \"normal\", 14.1),\n929:         (\"38. COFFEE BREAK\", \"★ DUAL CHARACTER SWITCHING UNLOCKED ★\\nEnables Fast Character Warping!\", \"badge\", 12.3),\n930:         (\"39. Hit Avery Pawn\", \"Store Robbery System Active\", \"normal\", 10.6),\n931:         (\"SKIP: Hit Kingpin Bowling\", \"Bypass secondary non-essential robberies\", \"badge\", 9.1),\n932:         (\"40-42. Kelly County Operations\", \"Impounded Vehicle recovery & Afternoon Delight\", \"normal\", 7.6),\n933:         (\"43. Prepare for Vice City\", \"Packing & Asset Liquidation\", \"normal\", 6.0),\n934:         (\"44. CHECKING OUT\", \"Port Gellhorn Climax -> Move to VC Safehouse\